 "own_rule_reading": [
  "session = a run of equal day_id (ET calendar day) in the registry master; a = the session's first bar",
  "opening range = bars a..a+5 (first 6 bars); range high = max(high), range low = min(low) over those bars; range = high - low",
  "threshold = median of the opening ranges of the 20 PRIOR sessions (today excluded); every prior session with >= 6 bars counts (narrow, wide, zero-range days alike); fewer than 20 prior sessions in the loaded window -> no trade (warm-up, first 20 sessions of 2010-06-07..)",
  "arm if range >= threshold (inclusive); skip if range <= 0; skip if the session has < 8 bars (6 OR bars + a signal bar + a fill bar)",
  "signal = the FIRST bar k >= a+6 whose close > range high (long) or close < range low (short), strict inequalities; only bars k whose k+1 is in the same session are scanned (a breakout on the session's last bar = no trade); only the first breakout counts, a failed/stopped breakout is not re-entered (one trade per session)",
  "fill at bar k+1's open",
  "stop (PRIMARY) = the explicit formula entry - side*0.5*range (half the opening range from the fill price); the words 'range midpoint' are read as a label for that formula; a VARIANT with the true midpoint (range high + range low)/2 is also reported",
  "stop checked intrabar from the entry bar on (long: low <= stop, short: high >= stop) and filled AT the stop; from the bar after entry, a bar that opens at/past the stop books its open; variant only: if the fill opens already past the true midpoint, exit at that open",
  "no take-profit; otherwise flat at the session's last bar CLOSE",
  "no look-ahead: OR, threshold and signal use only bars <= k; the fill is k+1's open; exits use only the bar being traded"
 ],
